><tr>\\n<th>Rarity</th>\\n<th>Chance\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"0\\\">Common</td>\\n<td>1%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"1\\\">Uncommon</td>\\n<td>37%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"2\\\">Rare</td>\\n<td>50%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"3\\\">Superior</td>\\n<td>12%\\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"8_Facilities\\\">8 Facilities</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Research_facility&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: 8 Facilities\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<table class=\\\"wikitable sortable\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th>Rarity</th>\\n<th>Chance\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"0\\\">Common</td>\\n<td>1%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"1\\\">Uncommon</td>\\n<td>23%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"2\\\">Rare</td>\\n<td>60%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td data-sort-value=\\\"3\\\">Superior</td>\\n<td>16%\\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Trivia\\\">Trivia</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Research_facility&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Trivia\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>It is the only facility in the game that has a cap in every region at 8 research facilities at maximum.\\nIf you went over the limit, you would receive the message: \\\"You can't have more than 8x of <code>research facility</code> in a region!\\\"\\n</p>\\n<!-- \\nNewPP limit report\\nCached time: 20261008151730\\nCache expiry: 86400\\nDynamic content: false\\nComplications: []\\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\\nPreprocessor genera